#: data/help/help.json
msgid "After 45 days, offer remaining warehouse stock to Omar or review an unsuccessful expansion honestly."
msgstr "45 天后，可向 Omar 报价出售剩货，或如实检讨未成功的扩张。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "After Chapter 13 opens the markets, register a company, open international banking and set local-currency prices in Company OS."
msgstr "第 13 章开放海外市集后，登记公司、开立国际帐户，再到公司电脑设置当地货币售价。"

#: scripts/ui/tutorial.gd:90
msgid "After a shift you're tired: go home and sleep in your bed (any time after work, or from 7 PM). Overnight your listing keeps selling and deliveries keep moving. Tomorrow, the city is yours."
msgstr "上完班累了：回家睡觉吧（下班后随时可以睡，或晚上 7 点以后）。夜里商品会继续卖、货也会继续送。明天起，这座城市任你闯。"

