msgid "All cost rows are in home dollars; the buyer quote is labelled with its own currency."
msgstr "各项成本都以本国元列示；买方报价另标明使用的货币。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/clerk_forms_game.gd:30
msgid "All good? Approve it. Something wrong? Click the wrong field first, then Reject."
msgstr "都没问题就「核准」。有错的话，先点出错的字段，再按「退件」。"

