msgstr "已经完成雇主登记了。"

#: data/products/phone_stand.json
msgid "Aluminium Phone Stand"
msgstr "铝合金手机架"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/photo_shoot_game.gd:293
msgid "Amateur-looking. It will cost you some sales; you can reshoot later."
msgstr "看起来很业余，会少一些订单；之后可以重拍。"

#: data/economy/staff.json
msgid "Ambitious: works harder, expects a raise within two months."
msgstr "有企图心：做得更拚，两个月内会期待加薪。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/barista_game.gd:7
msgid "Americano"
msgstr "美式咖啡"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "An appointment gets you to Marcus; it does not waive the company, account, credit, payment history, age or collateral requirements."
msgstr "预约能安排与 Marcus 洽谈，仍须符合公司、帐户、信用、缴款纪录、成立天数或担保资产等资格。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "An employee who takes your van out on one posted run each workday and banks the fee. They plan the route less well than you do."
msgstr "每个工作日开你的货车跑一趟外送、把运费收进帐上的员工。他们排路线没有你排得好。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "An office gives your company desks for staff, more storage and a proper address. Rent is charged every month."
msgstr "办公室让公司有员工座位、更多仓储空间和正式地址。每月收租。"

#: data/events/customs_hold.json
msgid "An unresolved hold is withdrawn after 7 days; the freight remains paid."
msgstr "扣留 7 天仍未处理，就会自动撤回包裹；已付运费不退还。"

#: data/npcs/ana.json
msgid "Ana"
msgstr "Ana"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "Ana at City Hall. The Payments Integrity Act is in force. Commercial importers need an import licence: $450 a year, at the permits kiosk. There's a monthly compliance cost now too."
msgstr "我是市政厅的 Ana。《支付诚信法》生效了。商业进口商需要进口执照：一年 $450，到许可服务站办。现在每个月还有一笔合规费用。"

#: data/jobs/city_clerk.json
msgid "Ana shows you the queue trick: ticket numbers are a suggestion."
