msgid "The bridge is open again, with limits and an insurance pool. Ninety cents on the dollar isn't nothing. It isn't a dollar either."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了，有限额，也有保险基金。拿回九成不是没有，但也不是全部。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:389
msgid "The bridge is open again, with limits and an insurance pool. Wires never stopped, so you lost nothing but a week of options. Split your payments across rails, and keep a wire route warm."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了，有限额，也有保险基金。电汇从没停过，你只是少了一周的选择，没有损失。付款要分散在不同管道，电汇这条路也要维持畅通。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:385
msgid "The bridge is open again."
msgstr "跨链桥重开了。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:387
