#: data/dialogue/victor_earnout.json
msgid "You asked for more and I said yes. Now you have a year to earn the rest."
msgstr "你要求更多，我答应了。现在你有一年的时间去赚剩下的。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You built {company} and sold it well. The desk is still yours."
msgstr "你一手打造 {company}，也卖了个好价钱。办公桌还是你的。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "You can ask for a higher headline price, but you carry the risk after the sale."
msgstr "你可以要求更高的开价，但卖出之后的风险要自己扛。"

