msgid "You can run a business and keep a job at the same time."
msgstr "做生意和打工可以同时进行。"

#: scripts/sim/event_engine.gd:170
msgid "You can't do that right now."
msgstr "现在不能这么做。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/job_modal.gd:49
msgid "You do the work yourself: the better the shift goes, the more you earn (60% of the wage is guaranteed)."
msgstr "工作要自己做：班做得越好，赚得越多（保底 60% 薪水）。"

#: data/jobs/city_clerk.json
msgid "You file three hundred registrations. You now know every business on your street."
msgstr "你归档了三百份登记，现在你认识你那条街上的每一家店了。"

#: data/events/acquisition_offer.json
msgid "You get {take} now and stay on as managing director. Hale Group owns the company from here: its cash stays in it, and you can't take money out."
msgstr "你现在拿到 {take}，继续担任总经理。从此公司归 Hale Group：公司的现金留在公司，你不能再领钱出来。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "You give up a few percent of an invoice to be paid now instead of in 60 days."
msgstr "让出发票金额的几个百分点，换对方现在就付款，不用等 60 天。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/cowork_desk_modal.gd:18
msgid "You have a monthly desk."
msgstr "你有月租座位了。"

#: scripts/ui/tutorial.gd:66
msgid "You have an order! Go to your packing table at home and press E. Pack it by hand: box, padding, tape, label."
msgstr "有订单了！到家里的打包桌按 E。亲手打包：箱子、缓冲材、胶带、标签。"

#: data/dialogue/lina_intro.json
msgid "You have three ways to pay abroad now."
msgstr "现在付款到国外有三种方式。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/overseas_partner_modal.gd:74
msgid "You keep the customer relationship and retail margin. Pay sea freight and duty before dispatch, monthly rent per unsold unit, and shipping for each sale. Slow stock still ties up cash."
msgstr "客户关系与零售毛利归你。出货前付海运费与关税，未售出库存按件付月租，每笔销售另付出货费；滞销仍会占用现金。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You kept the shelves full while half the city ran out. That's a real business."
msgstr "半个城市都断货，你还能把架上补满。这才是真正的生意。"

#: data/jobs/bank_teller.json
msgid "You learn the difference between revenue and cash, the hard way, on someone else's account."
msgstr "你在别人的帐户上，深刻体会到营收和现金的差别。"

#: data/jobs/barista.json
msgid "You learn the milk steamer's moods. Jun nods, approvingly."
msgstr "你摸清了蒸奶器的脾气。Jun 赞许地点点头。"

#: data/jobs/parcel_sorter.json
msgid "You learn which box sizes the couriers hate. Useful."
msgstr "你学到快递员最讨厌哪种尺寸的箱子。很有用。"

#: autoload/ui_root.gd:210
msgid "You left before the shift was done. No pay, and no time lost."
msgstr "你在班还没结束前就离开了。没有薪水，也没有花掉时间。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/job_modal.gd:68
msgid "You left the job at %s."
msgstr "你离开了%s的工作。"

#: scripts/ui/tutorial.gd:436
msgid "You left your job before working a shift. Take a job again at Bloom Coffee's staff door, then work a shift."
msgstr "你还没做过班就离职了。到 Bloom Coffee 员工入口重新应征，再做一个班。"

#: data/dialogue/jun_first.json
msgid "You look like you're plotting something."
msgstr "你看起来在盘算什么。"

#: scripts/sim/contracts.gd:227
msgid "You need %d in stock (have %d)."
msgstr "需要 %d 件库存（目前 %d 件）。"

