msgid "You pack %d by hand; the other %d get packed the same way once you have the rhythm."
msgstr "你亲手打包 %d 张；上手之后，其余 %d 张照同样的水准打包。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You packed boxes until 1 AM again, didn't you. You need help. Like, a person."
msgstr "你又打包到凌晨一点了对吧。你需要帮手，我是说，一个人。"

#: scripts/frontend/arrival_scene.gd:97
msgid "You quit your job. You have savings, a laptop, a phone — and a lease."
msgstr "你辞掉了工作。你有一笔存款、一台笔电、一支手机——还有一纸租约。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "You receive less per unit but avoid managing the final customers."
msgstr "每件收入较低，但不必管理终端客户。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "You retain retail customers and margin but fund slow stock and returns."
msgstr "保有零售客户与毛利，也须负担滞销与退货。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "You reviewed the trial and paused expansion. That is a business decision, not a sales target achieved. Existing parcels and foreign money still need settling."
msgstr "你检讨结果并暂停扩张。这是一个经营决定，不代表销售目标已达成。原有包裹与外币款项仍要处理。"

